==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|spedy}}, {{m|enm|spedi}}, from {{inh|en|ang|spēdiġ|t=having good speed, lucky, prosperous; having means, wealthy, opulent, rich in material wealth; rich in, abounding in, abundant, plenteous, copious; powerful}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*spōdigaz|t=successful, hurried}}, equivalent to {{af|en|speed|-y}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|spedie|t=speedy}}, {{cog|nl|spoedig|t=speedy, swift, rapid, quick}}, {{cog|de|sputig}}, {{m|de|spudig|t=industrious, speedy}}.

